    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1772930/extras/98427fc30f35b1edc2c23cde5d3d8191.poster.avif?t=1727399541\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1772930/extras/98427fc30f35b1edc2c23cde5d3d8191.webm?t=1727399541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1772930/extras/98427fc30f35b1edc2c23cde5d3d8191.mp4?t=1727399541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Many Things Can Change After A Trauma. </h2><br>For Nathan, the way he saw the world was affected after being shot in a robbery. When he acquires a new skill, he finds himself immersed in a sucession of events that, one by one, shakes the pillars of his already fragile life.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Technical Facts</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Multiple endings: your choices matter;<br></li><li> About 5 hours of gameplay;<br></li><li> 15+ backgrounds and 15+ CGs;<br></li><li> 20+ original songs.</li></ul>",
